WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:05.380
I am absolutely 100% fluent in Tagalog
after just one week

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:06.940
And that`s no lie.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:11.240
Well... actually, it is.
But... you know...

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.180
Hi guys, this is Paul

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.560
Last week I posted a video telling you
 about my intention to study Tagalog.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.180
And the question is: "did I actually follow through?"

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:30.420
Did I actually study it and
 follow the plan I had told you about?

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:36.760
Or did I sit around watching tv and drinking some Coke 
and eating chips and whatever, instead of studying?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.540
That's the question.
So I'd like to show you a bit of my week.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:44.680
What I did, and then show you the end result, 
which is some of what I learned during that week.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.800
So, have a look and see what you think.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.440
Hindi. Hindi ako nakakaintindi ng Tagalog.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.300
Angaling mo mag Tagalog.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.640
Tagalog Ang pronouns and Ng pronouns

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.200
Tagalog question words

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.520
Hindi akong masyadong mabuti.

00:01:16.089 --> 00:01:16.969
Paki sulat mo

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.385
"Please write that"

00:01:20.394 --> 00:01:22.314
"Could you write that? Yeah.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.620
Mamaya. That means "later".

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.320
Hindi ako gutom.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.740
Mali mali akong magtagalog.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:42.980
Pero nakakaintindi ako kaunti. NG kaunti.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.620
Making Anki flashcards.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.460
Puede bang magtanong?

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.060
Tubig ang gusto kong inumin.

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.280
Tubig ang gusto kong inumin.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:08.340
Ako rin. Kain tayo mamaya.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.200
Alright... Magandang tanghali, lahat! 
(Good evening, everyone)

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.740
Ang pangalan ko ay Paul.
(My name is Paul)

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:21.200
Nagagalak akong makilala kayo. 
(I am pleased to meet you)

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.920
Patawad dahil hindi ako masyadong marunong magtagalog.
(I'm sorry I can't speak much Tagalog)

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.700
Pero nakakaintindi ako ng kaunti.
(But I understand a little)

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:40.000
Isang linggo pa lang akong nag-aaral ng Tagalog.
(I've been studying Tagalog for only 1 week)

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:47.760
Nag-aaral ako ng Tagalog dahil madalas
 akong pumupunta sa Pilipinas. 
(I'm studying Tagalog because I often go to Philippines)

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:56.600
Isa akong Kanadian, pero nasa Hapon ako ngayon.
(I'm Canadian but, right now, I'm in Japan)

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.920
Nagtuturo ako ng inlges sa mga Hapones sa unibersidad.
(I teach English to Japanese people at an University)

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:10.320
At gusto ko ang trabaho ko sa unibersidad.
(And I like my job at the University)

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:16.160
Gusto kong mag-aral ng iba't ibang lingwahe,
(I like studying foreign languages)

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:20.060
at gusto kong maglakbay. 
(And I like travelling)

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:27.140
At gusto ko rin magbasa ng libro,
(And I also like reading books)

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.600
at magaral ng marami.
(And learning a lot)

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.540
At ngayon gusto kong gumawa ng bideyo para sa Youtube, 
(And now I like making videos for Youtube)

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:37.180
at sumulat ng blog.
(And i write a blog)

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:41.500
At sa libre kong oras,
(And, in my free time,)

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:49.240
gusto ko ring maglakwatsya kasama ang kaibigan ko. 
( I like to hang out with my friends. )

00:03:50.740 --> 00:04:00.960
Hindi ako nayayamot, dahil marami akong ginagawa! 
(I don't get bored, because I do a lot of things.)

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:05.620
Ok,... Magandang araw sa iyo! ... Bye.
(Have a good day)

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.300
Obviously I have a long way to go.

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.400
But I think I got off to a good start in my first week.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:16.680
If you love languages, don't forget to subscribe.

00:04:16.934 --> 00:04:18.934
Studying Tagalog is awesome, by the way!

